", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198854445622/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3668, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 228, "last_played": 1760904806, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love the open exploration and pals. They've got a lot of personality and it's fun to see how they act as wild creatures, base workers, and partners while travelling. Resource management is a big thing, but seeing pals rush to help you build and then get happy when the job's done is a really nice touch. Fighting isn't complicated, but is still dynamic. Highly recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1731013916, "timestamp_updated": 1731013916, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178580858", "author": {"steamid": "76561199073428161", "personaname": "XM855", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199073428161/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 21237, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8713, "deck_playtime_at_review": 61, "last_played": 1786306192, "avatar": "5076cb4b31180b9fb9b6520693e7906f4c89b8ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "palworld is awesome! if you like/liked pokemon and you like survival games, then you will probably love palworld. we should had pokemon games like this for decades at this point. nintendo didnt want to give us a game like this, but thankfully pocketpair did", "timestamp_created": 1731012619, "timestamp_updated": 1731012619, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "r